celebrity.quote_en:
@BLKMDL3 @wholemars If anyone is curious:

Since last year, we have had a pixel-perfect model of the world, which is crucial for the generation of synthetic data.

The (much smaller) version in the car is the conditional mean flow model, based on the latest sequence of Tesla's Universal Vision Encoder features, which are the same ones plugged into the car.

celebrity.full_text_en:
@anabology A Tesla is a conscious car. 

Of course, there is a limit to how much consciousness you want in a car. Or is there? 

Especially if it can access the Internet, the car has far more freedom of action than a GPU in a data center.

